i>\n<li><strong>Custom event tracking</strong> &#8211; Track outbound link clicks, contact form submissions, add-to-cart actions, and more.</li>\n<li><strong>Traffic spike alerts</strong> &#8211; Get notified by email when traffic changes quickly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kokoanalytics.com/koko-analytics-dashboard/#utm_source=wordpress.org&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=free-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">View the Koko Analytics live demo</a> or <a href=\"https://www.kokoanalytics.com/pricing/#utm_source=wordpress.org&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=free-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">see Koko Analytics Pro pricing</a>.</p>\n",
